            "review_title": "Review at Three Amigos Mexican Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Oliver E\nLondon, United Kingdom32 contributions\n0\nHits the spot\nDec 2016 • Couples\nMy girlfriend and I went on a sefl-directed \"Mexican Food Tour\" in Saigon. This was stop number two where we had a pitcher of Margaritas and a Mexican Pizza. We liked it. It was good and we got a bit tipsy. \n\nIt only gets 4 stars because it ranks #2 out of 3. There is one spot that was slightly more delicious.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 1, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
