            "review_title": "Review at Three Amigos Mexican Restaurant",
            "review_text": "rrlewis4\nChicago100 contributions\n0\nGot sick eating at this restaurant\nAug 2015 • Solo\nI thought I was getting a Mexican meal with either corn or flour tortillas filled with chicken and instead received fried wonton chips with chicken, and melted cheese on top of it and these were the tacos. I got sick eating this food and finally recovered after two days. The salsa served was bland and really could not be called salsa in any type of Mexican restaurant. The owner seemed like a nice man but it is a mistake to try to eat Mexican food in Vietnam. Instead sick with the local food. Service was fine though.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 25, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-05",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
