            "review_title": "Review at Three Amigos Mexican Restaurant",
            "review_text": "shanghaimum\nSingapore, Singapore244 contributions\n0\nDisappointing quality of food\nJun 2014 • Family\nWe were staying in Sofitel and decided to go for Mexican food as kids love it on 12th june We found this in the same area and took taxi however we left highly disappointed . \nWe ordered some starters -nachos which were average but main course was big disappointmentWe requested for chicken quesadilla, chicken burrito , taco and taquitos \n The chicken burrito came DEEP FRIED !!! Both burrito and taquitos were soaked /dripping in oil. Infact my husband just chucked the oil soaked tortilla . The Quesadilla hardly had meat and was just taco had loads and loads of lettuce that my younger daughter joked that it looked like she had ordered salad as chicken was hardly to be seen. We paid around $50 and came back totally dissatisfied . I am not even mentioning the service which we received !!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 26, 2014",
